  RootNode:
    dialogueText: "Safety Rules\r\n1) Frogs must not lick anything that hums.\r\n2)
      Any electric eel in a public canal must file Form 7-B.\r\n3) Complaints about
      shocks must be submitted within one day or will be considered expected outcomes.\r\n4)
      In the event of a blackout, all frogs must remain perfectly still while eels
      hum reassuringly.\r\n5) Eels experiencing an emotional surge must announce
      \u201CCHARGE RISING\u201D before entering shared waterways.\r\n\u2026"
